# A96/A97 (kernel desktop, sd-tera = sd-base + Apps\TERADESK\TERADESK.INF, no #Z):
# park bottom-right (never through the menu bar), dump the idle desktop (A);
# double-click APPS (178,104) in the boot C:\ window (B), TERADESK (202,128)
# in the C:\APPS\ window (C), DESKTOP.NAP (226,152) in the C:\APPS\TERADESK\
# window -> the desktop launches TeraDesk through run_gem_app (D, 10 s later);
# in TeraDesk double-click HARD DISC C (195,35) -> its C:\*.* window (E);
# File title (70,8) -> menu (F); Quit/Shutdown (130,235) -> the Quit/Shutdown
# Options dialog (G); Quit (320,313) -> TeraDesk ends, the desktop resumes
# (H, 4 s after the click; I, 2 s later). Ticks are 200 Hz after
# "[desk] desktop up" (A46 dual arming).
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 178 104
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2000 parkbr
2600 mark B_APPS
2900 move 202 128
3100 down
3103 up
3108 down
3111 up
